text Whenever I had spare time, I would give Nagisa a sick visit.
text I had a lot of fun talking not only with Nagisa, but also with Sanae-san.
text Though as always, the old man was the only one I found hard to deal with.
text I pass by a customer in front of the store.
sound R6M.aac
text @[Customer]
text Um... Okazaki... san?
text She calls me to a stop.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKO10.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I look back to see a woman with short hair looking at me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Er... Ibuki-san, was it?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO11"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKO11.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound R6N.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Yes.
text Where did I meet this woman...?
text Oh, that's right. It was the day before our match with the basketball club. We'd been inside the store, and Sanae-san had introduced her to me as Nagisa's former homeroom teacher.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKO10.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound R6O.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Did you come to visit Nagisa-chan?
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, kind of. Sanae-san and the rest are here too.
text @[Tomoya]
text Erm, you're not here for bread today, are you, Ibuki-san?
text That's what I say, after checking to see that she's got nothing in her hand.
sound R6P.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text That's right. I'm just here to say hi today, since I'm going to be leaving town for a while.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? Are you going back home or something?
sound R6Q.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text No, I'll be going one town over. My little sister is hospitalized there, and I want to stay by her side from now on.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah, so that's what it's about.
sound R6R.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Yes. So it looks like I won't be seeing you for a while either, Okazaki-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text You'll just be in the next town over. It's really not that far.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO11"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
