text @[Ibuki]
text ...
sound R6U.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Okazaki-san...
sound R6V.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text You know Koumura-sensei, don't you?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Eh?
text I'm taken aback at the unexpected mention of that name.
sound R6W.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Koumura-sensei. Who teaches ancient literature.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound R6X.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Was he your homeroom teacher during your first year?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
