sound R6Y.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text So, Okazaki-san... are you, well... going to university?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, that'd seriously be impossible. I'll probably just get a job.
sound R6Z.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text And your friend too?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...You know about us two?
text I ask in return, ignoring her question.
