text Oh, I'm sorry for prying like this.
sound R71.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text I just remembered what Nagisa-chan had told me before.
sound R72.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text How you two couldn't participate in sports anymore, even if you wanted to.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... what about that?
