sound R73.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text And so in that case, I was wondering if you and your friend might just be Koumura-sensei's final students.
text @[Tomoya]
text His final students...?
sound R74.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text That's right. Koumura-sensei's going to retire after this year.
text @[Tomoya]
text Really...? I didn't know.
text @[Tomoya]
text But he was only my homeroom during my first year, not this one.
sound R75.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text Yes, I know.
sound R76.aac
text @[Ibuki]
text When I say you're his final students, I don't mean as in the last ones to be taught by him.
