text I was glad I was at least able to take care of you two in the end...
text That's right...
text I'm sure he's been supporting us from the shadows even more than we could imagine.
text And I felt that, even more than I do now...
text That I would keep noticing his support, even in the far future.
text That's what I feel, from the bottom of my heart...
text I am who I am right now because of him.
text @[Tomoya]
text You know...
