text A huge crowd has formed in front of the school gates.
text They're all teachers and underclassmen.
sound R9I.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text You're telling me we have to walk through all that applause? Man, this sucks...
text Next to me, Sunohara sticks out his tongue.
text The school gates are bustling with applause and people giving us their blessings.
text Juniors from the same club, advisors, homeroom teachers. They all wave to us.
text Koumura is there too, standing a little ways off.
text Nobody goes to speak to him.
text He stands there alone, almost like a forgotten statue.
text Sunohara and I exchange glances.
