text I'd actually had the opportunity of talking to Ibuki-san on the phone at one time.
text At that point, Ibuki-san had told me she wanted us to thank Koumura-sensei.
text In those days when he was in his prime, it was apparently difficult for students to show their gratitude to him.
text That's why she wanted us, the final students he had looked after, to give him those words.
text However, it's not like Ibuki-san had coerced the words out of us.
text We knew that there's no meaning to words of gratitude if they don't come naturally.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s20
