	fi
fi
text ...We were his final students.
text Just those words had stayed with me, amazingly lucidly.
text I wonder if we were really good enough for that.
text So this is what Ibuki-san said in the end.
text It must be quite the honor for you.
text Since you're sure to remain in Koumura-sensei's memory forever...
text His life will be calm and quiet from now on...
text And during those calm, quiet days, he'll suddenly remember.
text His time as a teacher...
text And...
text He will remember those two bad students that he pulled through graduation.
